msgid "Full Disk Access needed"
msgstr "Full Disk Access needed"

msgid "FreeDiskCleaner needs Full Disk Access to measure folders macOS protects (Time Machine data, Mail, other apps' containers). Nothing leaves your Mac: no network, no telemetry."
msgstr "FreeDiskCleaner needs Full Disk Access to measure folders macOS protects (Time Machine data, Mail, other apps' containers). Nothing leaves your Mac: no network, no telemetry."

msgid "Open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access, enable FreeDiskCleaner, then come back and press \"Check again\"."
msgstr "Open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access, enable FreeDiskCleaner, then come back and press \"Check again\"."

